      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_14b",
      "hash64": "000E48C0EDCD6CC5",
      "text": "Tu as raison...\\nÇa ne va pas être facile, mais je vais essayer...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_15",
      "hash64": "6764B5CF024FEA12",
      "text": "En tout cas, je me sens beaucoup mieux.\\nMerci de m’avoir écoutée, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_16",
      "hash64": "6764B4CF024FE85F",
      "text": "Et je veux que tu saches que... toi aussi...\\ntu es un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ami[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e très ch[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]erère à mon cœur.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
